"Fixed-size Chunker"},{"id":"semantic_chunker","label":"semantic chunkers"}]},{"citationId":"c8","pages":[{"id":"f1_score","label":"F1 scores"},{"id":"fixed_size_chunker","label":"Fixed-size Chunker"},{"id":"positional_information","label":"positional information"}]}],"mentions":[{"citationId":"c9"},{"citationId":"c7"},{"citationId":"c19"},{"citationId":"c17"},{"citationId":"c4"},{"citationId":"c6"},{"citationId":"c20"},{"citationId":"c18"},{"citationId":"c13"},{"citationId":"c21"}],"mentionsLeftOut":9,"citations":[{"id":"c1","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_f8a88345a7ca9bdb","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":1,"quote":"“chunkers.” Fixed-size Chunker This is our baseline chunker that splits a document sequentially into fixed-size chunks, based on a predefined or user-specified number of sentences per chunk."},{"id":"c2","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_db87287a4bc97586","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":14,"quote":"hyperparameter values for Fixed-size Chunker. Left: Document Retrieval; Right: Evidence Retrieval."},{"id":"c3","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_267bb9040788f52b","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":4,"quote":"4.3 Evidence Retrieval As shown in Table 2, Fixed-size Chunker per- formed best on 3 out of 5 datasets, indicating a slight edge in capturing core evidence sentences."},{"id":"c4","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_b30d80c76bcfd4a7","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":4,"quote":"However, the performance differences between the Fixed-size Chunker and the two semantic chunkers were minimal, suggesting no clear advantage for any specific chunking strategy."},{"id":"c5","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_10f57c2260ce3d16","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":9,"quote":"E.1 Results for Answer Generation As shown in Table 7, semantic chunkers performed slightly better than Fixed-size Chunker in terms of QA cosine similarity."},{"id":"c6","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_7b79964ed96d7d7b","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":4,"quote":"4.4 Results for Answer Generation As shown in Tables 3, Semantic Chunkers per- formed slightly better than Fixed-size Chunker based on BERTScore, but the differences are mini- mal, making it difficult to draw any definitive con- clusions."},{"id":"c7","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_523725d1f0094d60","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":2,"quote":"When λ = 0, the chunker operates purely based on semantic similarity; when λ = 1, it mirrors the Fixed-size Chunker."},{"id":"c8","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_9e8e482cc4774faa","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":10,"quote":"In addition, Figure 2 shows that as λ approaches 1 (representing the Fixed-size Chunker), the F1 score (green line) gradually increases, indicating that positional information contributed more to re- trieval performance than semantic"},{"id":"c9","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_f8a88345a7ca9bdb","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":1,"quote":"(a) Fixed-size Chunker splits the document into consecutive, uniform chunks without considering semantic content."},{"id":"c10","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_267bb9040788f52b","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":4,"quote":"However, the performance differences between the Fixed-size Chunker and the two semantic chunkers were minimal, suggesting no clear advantage for any specific chunking strategy."},{"id":"c11","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_267bb9040788f52b","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":4,"quote":"These results suggest that in real life, the topics in a document may not be as diverse as in our artificially noisy, stitched data, and hence semantic chunkers may not have an edge over fixed-size chunker there."},{"id":"c12","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_e5772b996828900d","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":10,"quote":"However, Fig- ure 2 shows that while recall remains steady, pre- cision rises significantly as chunk size decreases, even when λ = 1 (the Fixed-size Chunker case)."},{"id":"c13","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_44a7d7da885bdfd9","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":7,"quote":"B Hyperparameters Fixed-size Chunker We tested two hyperparam- eters: the number of chunks and the number of overlapping sentences between consecutive chunks."},{"id":"c14","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_62420926b42495e1","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":11,"quote":"The Fixed-size Chunker, which ig- nores semantic relationships and document struc- ture, frequently misassigned sentences, leading to errors that propagated through subsequent chunks."},{"id":"c15","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_0bbe8107207d6466","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":11,"quote":"It could, like the Fixed-size Chunker, group a sentence with a different chunk due to low seman- tic similarity with neighboring sentences, as seen with Sentence 4 being moved to Chunk 2."},{"id":"c16","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_c0c23ec7486789bd","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":11,"quote":"The Fixed-size Chunker repeated its issue from stitched documents, occasionally grouping sentences from adjacent sections into the same chunk, and this er- ror could be easily fixed by splitting the document by sections beforehand."},{"id":"c17","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_267bb9040788f52b","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":4,"quote":"The gap between semantic and fixed-size chunkers narrowed, with Fixed-size Chunker benefiting from higher topic integrity."},{"id":"c18","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_81b89429614de17d","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":5,"quote":"hile we attempted to address this by overlapping sentences in Fixed-size Chunker and incorporating positional distance in Seman- tic Chunker (global), the embeddings themselves remained context-free."},{"id":"c19","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_fc69e0b6eebd261b","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":3,"quote":"4.2 Document Retrieval Table 1 shows varied chunker performance, with Fixed-size Chunker excelling on non-stitched datasets and Semantic Chunkers performing better on stitched datasets."},{"id":"c20","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_cf1b7dfeca5d2412","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":4,"quote":"While we attempted to address this by overlapping sentences in Fixed-size Chunker and incorporating positional distance in Seman- tic Chunker (global), the embeddings themselves remained context-free."},{"id":"c21","chunkId":"8bbe93a93b05967d_c_c2250bf43a3ca573","docId":"8bbe93a93b05967d","docTitle":"2410.13070_Is_Semantic_Chunking_Worth_the_Computational_Cost","page":7,"quote":"Clustering-based Semantic Chunker For the single-linkage chunker, we tested two hyperparam- eters: λ, which controls the weight of the positional distance in t